    "name": "island-content",
    "type": "registry:component",
    "title": "Island content kit",
    "description": "Shared look for island content: colours, type sizes, compact and expanded text styles, the glyph set (Hugeicons' free icons drawn at the island's weight, solid where system glyphs are, and glyphFrom to make more), the expanded view's safe area (bottom rows and buttons that stay concentric with the island's corners), and useActivity, which binds an activity to a component's lifetime.",
